#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/x_motdom.xml
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	sites
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Full
#Data requested:	Site annotations
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: NO
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#SITES
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<annot-type>	<title>	<residue(coordinates)>	<complete-size>	<mapped-size>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDSITES
#MOTIFS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<title>	<from>	<to>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDMOTIFS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	RPSBLAST 2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	136	NP_416435.1 flagellar biosynthesis protein FliS [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
SITES
1	Query_1	Specific	heterodimer interface	Q25,V28,M30,L31,G34,K60,N63,I64,G68,L69,S72,L73,L81,N84,A87,L88,Y89,Y91,E110,V111,A113,L114,N117,I118,A121,W122,E124	29	27	294015
ENDSITES
MOTIFS
1	Query_1	coiled coil	Q25	45F	294015
1	Query_1	coiled coil	Q51	73L	294015
1	Query_1	coiled coil	L81	97L	294015
1	Query_1	coiled coil	S106	124E	294015
ENDMOTIFS
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
ENDDATA
